  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 301.22 Supervision of plumbing apprentices and fuel gas trainees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.22 “Supervision of plumbing apprentices and fuel gas trainees” means the direct supervision of a student or plumbing apprentice or fuel gas trainee while the individual is in the process of learning and applying his/her skills or is assisting a licensed fuel gas fitter or plumber.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15",
